NOTICE: games in MeshToys
=========================

MeshToys contains two text adventures that come from other people's work: Dungeon
(the mainframe Zork), described in part 1, and Colossal Cave Adventure, described in
part 2. They are separate, and their licence positions differ.

PART 1: Dungeon (mainframe Zork)
================================

The files zork/engine_gen.py, zork/dtextc.dat, zork/rt.py and zork/dungeon.py, and
the tools that produced them (tools/c2py.py, tools/crosscheck.py), are part of a
Python translation of DUNGEON, the mainframe version of ZORK. They are NOT covered
by any licence MeshToys itself may carry. They are derived from the work of others
and carry the notice below.

